ValDex is a Windows player inspired by Vivi Music:
https://github.com/vivizzz007/vivi-music

Vivi Music is GPL-3.0. Its reuse rules are at:
https://github.com/vivizzz007/vivi-music/blob/main/rules.md

This repository does not include Vivi Music's Musixmatch lyrics module
or its JioSaavn streaming module. Those two parts are the modules that
rules.md tells a reuse to credit inside the app. They are not in ValDex.
Lyrics here come from LRCLIB, then from YouTube Music.

Vivi Music credits Metrolist by Mostafa Alagamy as the project that
inspired it: https://github.com/mostafaalagamy/Metrolist
